喝😂，麵條軟硬度適中，老闆配合的麵條製造商真的很厲害，那個口感吃起來很像一層一層帶有口感的顆粒，嚼在嘴巴裡面的那種感覺，讓自己十分難忘，轉味的松露、檸檬巧思讓人吃了兩碗拉麵的滿足感，這點我與Jacko Huang是同樣的心得。\n\n與老闆回覆一下：塩味清湯回歸後，我一定會回訪吃吃看，沒吃過的品項真令人期待。",null,[0,126]]]],[null,1780386374000000,1780386374000000,"3 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfMHZZYWotcGR0NjM2QnJEX3hGTXV0UQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfMHZZYWotcGR0NjM2QnJEX3hGTXV0URoTQ2d3SXhwVDYwQVlReW9PNDRnSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjO75fdwNKWAxV_ZfUHHT-kLCsQ_2MIXSgM"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2904753738490998532/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvZEdWRVZsZE9NR2hwWWtaa2MyUXpaRUpOVldoS1QxaEtXbEp1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2904753738490998532/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvZEdWRVZsZE9NR2hwWWtaa2MyUXpaRUpOVldoS1QxaEtXbEp1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2904753738490998532/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvZEdWRVZsZE9NR2hwWWtaa2MyUXpaRUpOVldoS1QxaEtXbEp1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2904753738490998532/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvZEdWRVZsZE9NR2hwWWtaa2MyUXpaRUpOVldoS1QxaEtXbEp1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2904753738490998532/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvZEdWRVZsZE9NR2hwWWtaa2MyUXpaRUpOVldoS1QxaEtXbEp1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2904753738490998532/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvZEdWRVZsZE9NR2hwWWtaa2MyUXpaRUpOVldoS1QxaEtXbEp1WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["不好意思因人手不足 \u0026 新人熟悉中陣痛期，讓您久等了... 我們會盡快恢復正常速度，也歡迎您再來吃麵🙏\n（目前定番是醬油/白湯/極濃，第四碗品項等人員上手後會恢復供應 - 沒意外會是塩味清湯。黑蒜可能要等秋冬了喔...",null,[0,109]]]],[null,null,5477,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25odGVEVldOMGhpYkZkc2QzZEJNVWhKT1hKWlJuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xff3e7c5152b